---
import ActionLink from '../components/ActionLink.astro';
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import ContentSection from '../components/ContentSection.astro';
---
<Page title={"\"For all things come from You, and of your own we have given you.\" "}>
  <ContentSection>
    <h2>1 Chronicles 29:14</h2>
  </ContentSection>
  <ContentSection>
    <h2>Support the Ministry of St John's Darlinghurst</h2>
  </ContentSection>
  <ContentSection>
    <p>St John’s relies on the generosity of its members and community to fund its ministries in Darlinghurst and beyond. Your support will allow us to do even more. So, for the sake of your own spiritual growth, as well as the growth of God’s kingdom, we invite you to partner with us financially.</p>
  </ContentSection>
  <ContentSection>
    <h2>Ways to give</h2>
    <h2>Direct Deposit</h2>
    <h2>Give Online</h2>
    <p>Click below to give securely online using your bank or credit card.</p>
    <ActionLink href={"https://give.tithe.ly/?formId=534cb90a-6865-11ee-90fc-1260ab546d11&kiosk=true"}>GIVE ONLINE</ActionLink>
    <h2>Cheque</h2>
  </ContentSection>
</Page>
